# test_pg_util: integration-style tests for the async-with-timeout
# libpq helper.  The DB-dependent tests skip cleanly when no postgres
# is reachable (the default in Bazel sandbox / CI), so this test
# target stays green by default.  To exercise the timeout / cancel /
# PQreset paths against a real DB, set ONVIF_TEST_DB_CONN before
# invoking `bazel test`.
